id=netstats-fix
name=Network Stats Fix for GSI
version=v10
versionCode=10
author=opencode
description=Universal fix for broken traffic indicator on Android 16 GSIs. Multi-layer approach: (1) BPF repair via kver_override + bpfloader restart, (2) Native binder proxy fallback that reads /proc/net/dev directly, (3) SELinux policy fixes. Works on kernels 4.4+
